# Normalise line endings so diffs stay readable.
# Files written from the Cowork session use LF; git on Windows would otherwise
# rewrite them to CRLF on checkout and every future edit would show as a
# whole-file change. Pin LF in the repository for everything textual.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Solidity and JS are always text
*.sol text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf

# Images are binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
